  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Good luck follows you around.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Fortunate One<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The number of times per day you can use the adaptable luck trait is increased by one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1). When you use a mythic surge, you may expend one use of your adaptable luck at the same time to maximize the result of the surge die. You must choose to do this before you roll the surge die.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc159\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
